{"words": [{"text": "أَمْ", "translation": "Or"}, {"text": "كُنتُمْ", "translation": "were you"}, {"text": "شُهَدَآءَ", "translation": "witnesses"}, {"text": "إِذْ", "translation": "when"}, {"text": "حَضَرَ", "translation": "came to"}, {"text": "يَعْقُوبَ", "translation": "Yaqub"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَوْتُ", "translation": "[the] death"}, {"text": "إِذْ", "translation": "when"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "he said"}, {"text": "لِبَنِيهِ", "translation": "to his sons"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "What"}, {"text": "تَعْبُدُونَ", "translation": "will you worship"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِى", "translation": "after me"}, {"text": "قَالُوا۟", "translation": "They said"}, {"text": "نَعْبُدُ", "translation": "We will worship"}, {"text": "إِلَـٰهَكَ", "translation": "your God"}, {"text": "وَإِلَـٰهَ", "translation": "and (the) God"}, {"text": "ءَابَآئِكَ", "translation": "(of) your forefathers"}, {"text": "إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ", "translation": "Ibrahim"}, {"text": "وَإِسْمَـٰعِيلَ", "translation": "and Ishmael"}, {"text": "وَإِسْحَـٰقَ", "translation": "and Isaac "}, {"text": "إِلَـٰهًۭا", "translation": "God"}, {"text": "وَٰحِدًۭا", "translation": "One"}, {"text": "وَنَحْنُ", "translation": "And we"}, {"text": "لَهُۥ", "translation": "to Him"}, {"text": "مُسْلِمُونَ", "translation": "(are) submissive"}], "sahih": "Or were you witnesses when death approached Jacob, when he said to his sons, \"What will you worship after me?\" They said, \"We will worship your God and the God of your fathers, Abraham and Ishmael and Isaac - one God.1 And we are Muslims [in submission] to Him.\""}